steps.message:
In the OpenAPI schema, I see:
```json
"schema": {
  "anyOf": [
    {
      "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Cat"
    },
    {
      "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Dog"
    }
  ],
  "title": "Pet"
}
```
It's missing the `discriminator` object. A tagged union with discriminator should have something like:
```json
"schema": {
  "anyOf": [ ... ],
  "discriminator": {
    "propertyName": "type"
  },
  "title": "Pet"
}
```

So the problem is that the discriminator is lost when using `Annotated[Union[...], Field(discriminator="type"), Body()]`.

